@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
scale 1 as 70 pixels
hide time-axis

concise "接收记录" as R
concise "批次" as B
concise "实例" as I

@0
R is "r1"
B is "开放（批次 N）"
I is "空闲"

@1
R is "r2"

@2
R is "锁存"
B is "N 已关闭"
I is "求值 N"

@3
R is "r3"

@4
I is "提交 + 分发 N"

@5
R is "r4"

@6
R is "锁存"
B is "N+1 已关闭：r3, r4"
I is "求值 N+1"

@7
R is "-"
I is "空闲"

B@2 <-> @6 : r3 和 r4 在锁存之后到达 -> 等待 N+1
@enduml
